---
description: Write feedback for bugs or change requests for the api developer
---

Check CLAUDE.md for the path to the api (Related Projects section).
If it doesn't contain it, ask the user for it and store it in CLAUDE.md for next time.

Then in the api directory in the folder `feedback/` write a new md file with `yyyy_mm_dd_TITLE.md` format of what changes you need.

NOTE: This command writes feedback for the API team. If the user wants to IMPLEMENT changes from existing feedback reports, use /feedback:implement-new-api-changes instead.
